  "units": [
    {
      "end_seconds": 5.164,
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 0.061,
      "text": "So when you have an agent that's impersonating you, it is running in your security context."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 8.106,
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 5.184,
      "text": "It inherits whatever permissions you have."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 11.317,
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 8.287,
      "text": "So for example, like if I have an agent impersonating me,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 15.011,
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 11.337,
      "text": "I have the ability to delete all of the files off of my computer."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 18.061,
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 15.031,
      "text": "And if this agent is impersonating me, it too can delete all"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 20.833,
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 18.081,
      "text": "of the files off of my computer if it really goes sideways."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 23.778,
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 20.868,
      "text": "But if I make an autopilot and it has its own identity,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 27.14,
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 23.798000000000002,
      "text": "then first of all, it can't just delete my files."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 29.31,
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 27.16,
      "text": "It can't even see my files because it's a totally"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 31.951,
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 29.33,
      "text": "different user, just like you're a different user from me."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 37.423,
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 31.971,
      "text": "Unless I specifically give it that access, unless I affirmatively grant it that access."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 43.113,
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 37.443,
      "text": "And so the way that we're using this notion of agent identities is really"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 45.545,
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 43.133,
      "text": "towards the principle of least privilege, which you probably heard of that."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 49.37,
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 45.565,
      "text": "You know, this idea that you want to give people and now agents."
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 54.286,
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 49.39,
      "text": "the least number of privileges as possible for them to be able to do their job and no more than that,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 55.73,
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "guest:marco-casalaina",
      "speaker_name": "Marco Casalaina",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 54.306,
      "text": "so that they can't go sideways."
    }
